msgstr "Neveljaven datum \"%1\" (mora biti v obliki yyyy-mm-dd)."

#: CRM/Member/BAO/Membership.php
msgid ""
"Oops, it looks like there is no valid membership status corresponding to the"
" membership start and end dates for this membership. Contact the site "
"administrator for assistance."
msgstr "Videti je, da za začetni in končni datum tega članstva ni veljavnega statusa članstva. Za pomoč se obrnite na skrbnika sistema."

#: CRM/Member/BAO/Membership.php
msgid ""
"Deceased Membership status is missing or not active. <a href='%1'>Click here"
" to check</a>."
msgstr "Stanje članstva za pokojne manjka ali ni aktiven. <a href='%1'>Kliknite tukaj za preverjanje</a>."

#: CRM/Member/BAO/Membership.php
msgid "Processed %1 membership records. Updated %2 records."
msgstr "Obdelanih je bilo %1 zapisov članstva. Posodobljenih je bilo %2 zapisov."

#: CRM/Member/BAO/Membership.php
msgid ""
"%1 Current membership(s) for this contact have been set to 'Deceased' "
"status."
msgstr "%1 trenutnih članstev tega stika je bilo nastavljenih na stanje »Pokojni«."

#: CRM/Member/BAO/MembershipStatus.php
msgid ""
"This membership status cannot be deleted. Memberships exist with this "
"status."
msgstr "Tega statusa članstva ni mogoče izbrisati. Obstajajo članstva s tem statusom."

#: CRM/Member/BAO/MembershipType.php
msgid "This membership type cannot be deleted due to following reason(s):"
msgstr "Te vrste članstva ni mogoče izbrisati zaradi naslednjih razlogov:"

#: CRM/Member/BAO/MembershipType.php
msgid ""
"%3. There are some contacts who have this membership type assigned to them. "
"Search for contacts with this membership type from <a href='%1'>Find "
"Members</a>. If you are still getting this message after deleting these "
"memberships, there may be contacts in the Trash (deleted) with this "
"membership type. Try using <a href=\"%2\">Advanced Search</a> and checking "
"\"Search Deleted Contacts\"."
msgstr "%3. Nekateri stiki imajo dodeljeno to vrsto članstva. Poiščite stike s to vrsto članstva preko <a href='%1'>Najdi člane</a>. Če se to sporočilo še vedno prikazuje po izbrisu teh članstev, so morda v košu (izbrisani stiki) s to vrsto članstva. Poskusite uporabiti <a href=\"%2\">Napredno iskanje</a> in označiti »Išči izbrisane stike«."

#: CRM/Member/BAO/MembershipType.php
msgid ""
"%2. This Membership Type is used in an <a href='%1'>Online Contribution "
"page</a>. Uncheck this membership type in the Memberships tab."
msgstr "%2. Ta vrsta članstva se uporablja na <a href='%1'>strani spletnih prispevkov</a>. Odznačite to vrsto članstva v zavihku Članstva."

