#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"WARNING: Deleting this membership will also delete any related payment "
"(contribution) records."
msgstr "OPOZORILO: Izbris tega članstva bo izbrisal tudi vse povezane evidence plačil (prispevkov)."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"Consider modifying the membership status instead if you want to maintain an "
"audit trail and avoid losing payment data. You can set the status to "
"Cancelled by editing the membership and clicking the Status Override "
"checkbox."
msgstr "Razmislite o spremembi statusa članstva, če želite ohraniti revizijsko sled in preprečiti izgubo podatkov o plačilih. Status lahko nastavite na Preklicano tako, da uredite članstvo in kliknete potrditveno polje Prepis statusa."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Click 'Delete' if you want to continue."
msgstr "Kliknite »Izbriši«, če želite nadaljevati."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"This Membership is linked to a contribution. You must have 'delete in "
"CiviContribute' permission in order to delete this record."
msgstr "To članstvo je povezano s prispevkom. Za izbris tega zapisa morate imeti dovoljenje »izbriši v CiviContribute«."

