msgstr "Cenovni sklop članstva"

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.php
msgid ""
"The membership price set associated with this online contribution allows a "
"user to select BOTH an auto-renew AND a non-auto-renew membership. This "
"requires submitting multiple processor transactions, and is not supported "
"for one or more of the payment processors enabled under the Amounts tab."
msgstr "Cenovni sklop članstva, povezan s tem spletnim prispevkom, uporabniku omogoča izbiro tako samodejno obnovljivega kot neobnovljivega članstva. To zahteva oddajo več transakcij procesorju plačil in ni podprto za enega ali več omogočenih ponudnikov plačil na zavihku Zneski."

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.php
msgid ""
"Please select at least one Membership Type to include in the Membership "
"section of this page."
msgstr "Izberite vsaj eno vrsto članstva za vključitev v razdelek članstva na tej strani."

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.php
msgid ""
"You cannot select more than %1 choices. For more complex functionality, "
"please use a Price Set."
msgstr "Ne morete izbrati več kot %1 možnosti. Za bolj kompleksne funkcionalnosti uporabite cenovni sklop."

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.php
msgid ""
"You need to enable Separate Membership Payment when online contribution page"
" is configured for both Membership and Recurring Contribution"
msgstr "Kadar je spletna stran za prispevke nastavljena za članstva in ponavljajoče prispevke, morate omogočiti ločeno plačilo članstva"

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.php
msgid ""
"You cannot enable both Recurring Contributions and Auto-renew memberships on"
" the same online contribution page"
msgstr "Na isti spletni strani za prispevke ne morete omogočiti tako ponavljajočih prispevkov kot samodejno obnovljivih članstev"

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.php
msgid "Add status rules, before configuring membership"
msgstr "Pred konfiguracijo članstva dodajte pravila statusa"

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.php
msgid "Can't set default option for an unchecked membership type."
msgstr "Ni mogoče nastaviti privzete možnosti za neoznačeno vrsto članstva."

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.php
msgid "Please enable the contribution amount section to use this option."
msgstr "Za uporabo te možnosti omogočite razdelek za znesek prispevka."

