msgstr "Zabeleži plačilo obnove?"

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.php
msgid "Renewal Message"
msgstr "Sporočilo o obnovi"

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.php
msgid ""
"Oops. It looks like you are trying to change the membership type while "
"renewing the membership. Please click the \"change membership type\" link, "
"and select a Membership Organization."
msgstr "Ups. Videti je, da poskušate med obnovo spremeniti vrsto članstva. Kliknite povezavo »spremeni vrsto članstva« in izberite organizacijo članstva."

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.php
msgid ""
"Oops. It looks like you are trying to change the membership type while "
"renewing the membership. Please click the \"change membership type\" link "
"and select a Membership Type from the list."
msgstr "Ups. Videti je, da poskušate med obnovo spremeniti vrsto članstva. Kliknite povezavo »spremeni vrsto članstva« in s seznama izberite vrsto članstva."

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.php
msgid "Renewal date must be the same or later than Member Since."
msgstr "Datum obnovitve mora biti enak ali poznejši od datuma članstva."

#: CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.php
