#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.hlp
msgid ""
"A recurring payment (subscription) request will be submitted to the selected"
" payment processor. If the request is successful, this membership will be "
"automatically renewed on the last day of the membership period until the "
"recurring payment is cancelled. Membership payment receipt emails will "
"include a link for the member to cancel the auto-renewal."
msgstr "Zahteva za ponavljajoče se plačilo (naročnino) bo poslana izbranemu plačilnemu procesorju. Če je zahteva uspešna, bo to članstvo samodejno podaljšano na zadnji dan članskega obdobja, dokler periodično plačilo ni preklicano. E-poštna sporočila s potrdili o plačilu članstva bodo vsebovala povezavo za preklic samodejnega podaljšanja."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.hlp
msgid "To cancel automatic renewal:"
msgstr "Če želite preklicati samodejno podaljšanje:"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.hlp
msgid ""
"If this recurring payment uses a processor which has support for integrated "
"cancellation, click \"Cancel\" on this form, and use the \"Cancel Auto-renew"
" Subscription\" action (click \"more\" in the membership listing row)."
msgstr "Če to ponavljajoče se plačilo uporablja procesor, ki podpira integrirano preklic, kliknite »Prekliči« na tem obrazcu in uporabite dejanje »Prekliči samodejno obnovitev naročnine« (kliknite »več« v vrstici s seznamom članov)."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.hlp
msgid ""
"If you do not see the \"Cancel Auto-renew Subscription\" action, you will "
"need to cancel the associated Recurring Contribution record from the "
"Contributions tab. <strong>In this case you must also manually cancel the "
"recurring payment from the payment processor website</strong>."
msgstr "Če ne vidite dejanja »Prekliči samodejno podaljšanje naročnine«, boste morali preklicati povezani zapis o ponavljajočem se prispevku na kartici »Prispevki«.  <strong> V tem primeru morate tudi ročno preklicati ponavljajoče se plačilo na spletni strani plačilnega procesorja </strong>."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.tpl
msgid ""
"To stop the automatic renewal:\n"
"      <a href=\"%1\">Cancel auto-renew</a>\n"
"    "
msgstr "Če želite ustaviti samodejno podaljšanje:\n       <a href=\"%1\"> Prekliči samodejno podaljšanje </a>\n    "

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.tpl
msgid ""
"You will not be able to send an automatic email receipt for this Membership "
"because there is no email address recorded for this contact. If you want a "
"receipt to be sent when this Membership is recorded, click Cancel and then "
"click Edit from the Summary tab to add an email address before recording the"
" Membership."
msgstr "Samodejnega e-poštnega potrdila za to članstvo ne boste mogli poslati, ker za ta stik ni zabeležen e-poštni naslov. Če želite, da se ob evidentiranju tega članstva pošlje potrdilo, kliknite Prekliči in nato kliknite Uredi na zavihku Povzetek, da dodate e-poštni naslov pred beleženjem članstva."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this form to submit Membership Record on behalf of %1. <strong>A %2 "
