msgid "Renew the existing membership instead"
msgstr "Namesto tega podaljšaj obstoječe članstvo"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStandalone.js
msgid "View all existing and / or expired memberships for this contact"
msgstr "Oglejte si vsa obstoječa in/ali potekla članstva za ta stik"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStandalone.js
msgid "Duplicate Membership?"
msgstr "Podvojeno članstvo?"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.tpl
msgid "Manual membership and price"
msgstr "Ročno članstvo in cena"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.tpl
msgid "No contacts are currently eligible to inherit this relationship."
msgstr "Noben stik trenutno ni primeren za dedovanje tega odnosa."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.tpl
msgid "One contact is currently eligible to inherit this relationship."
msgstr "En stik je trenutno upravičen do podedovanja tega odnosa."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Membership.tpl
msgid "%1 contacts are currently eligible to inherit this relationship."
msgstr "%1 stiki so trenutno upravičeni do podedovanja tega razmerja."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid ""
"Price sets allow you to configure more complex membership signup and renewal"
" options, including allowing constituents to sign up for multiple "
"memberships at the same time."
msgstr "Nabori cen vam omogočajo, da konfigurirate bolj zapletene možnosti prijave in podaljšanja članstva, vključno z omogočanjem, da se udeleženci prijavijo za več članstev hkrati."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid ""
"If checked, user must signup for one of the displayed membership options "
"before continuing."
msgstr "Če je označeno, se mora uporabnik pred nadaljevanjem prijaviti za eno od prikazanih možnosti članstva."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you are including both Membership Signup/Renewal AND a "
"Contribution Amount section, AND you want the membership fee to be handled "
"as a separate transaction."
msgstr "Označite to polje, če vključujete oboje: Vpis/podaljšanje članstva IN razdelek Znesek prispevka IN želite, da se članarina obravnava kot ločena transakcija."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid ""
"With this configuration, the membership fee is automatically charged, and "
"users have an option to make an additional contribution (two separate "
"payment transactions will be generated)."
msgstr "Pri tej konfiguraciji se članarina samodejno zaračuna, uporabniki pa imajo možnost dodatnega prispevka (generirani bosta dve ločeni plačilni transakciji)."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid ""
"The contribution amount covering the membership fee will use the financial "
"type configured with the selected membership type (see the membership types "
"configuration tool to review those settings). Any additional contribution "
"will use the financial type configured for this online contribution page."
msgstr "Znesek prispevka, ki pokriva članarino, bo uporabil finančno vrsto, konfigurirano z izbrano vrsto članstva (za pregled teh nastavitev glejte orodje za konfiguracijo vrst članstva). Za morebitne dodatne prispevke bo uporabljen finančni tip, konfiguriran za to stran s spletnimi prispevki."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid ""
"If this option is NOT checked and you include a Contribution Amount section,"
" then a single transaction is processed for their contribution amount which "
"must at least cover the selected membership fee."
msgstr "Če ta možnost NI označena in vključite razdelek Znesek prispevka, se za znesek prispevka obdela ena transakcija, ki mora pokriti vsaj izbrano članarino."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid ""
"When this box is checked, the membership fee is included in the listing of "
"each membership option on the signup and renewal page. This is recommended "
"for most configurations."
msgstr "Ko je to polje označeno, je članarina vključena v seznam vsake možnosti članstva na strani za prijavo in podaljšanje. To je priporočljivo za večino konfiguracij."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid ""
"If the page is configured with 'Separate Membership Payment' enabled - then "
"just the fee amount is displayed:"
msgstr "Če je stran konfigurirana z omogočenim 'Ločeno plačilo članstva' - potem je prikazan samo znesek pristojbine:"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid "General Membership - $100.00"
msgstr "Splošno članstvo - 100,00 USD"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid ""
"If the page 'Separate Membership Payment' is NOT enabled AND the "
"Contribution Amount is enabled so that user's can opt to give more than the "
"minimum membership fee - then the display looks like this:"
msgstr "Če stran 'Ločeno plačilo članstva' NI omogočena IN je omogočen znesek prispevka, tako da se uporabniki lahko odločijo dati več od minimalne članarine - potem je prikaz videti takole:"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.hlp
msgid ""
"General Membership (contribute at least $100.00 to be eligible for this "
"membership)"
msgstr "Splošno članstvo (prispevajte vsaj 100,00 USD, da ste upravičeni do tega članstva)"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this form to enable and configure a Membership Signup and Renewal "
"section for this Online Contribution Page. If you're not using this page for"
" membership signup, leave the <strong>Enabled</strong> box un-checked.."
msgstr "S tem obrazcem omogočite in konfigurirajte razdelek za prijavo in podaljšanje članstva za to spletno stran za prispevke. Če te strani ne uporabljate za prijavo članstva, pustite polje <strong> Enabled </strong> nepotrjeno."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.tpl
msgid ""
"Click <a id='memQuickconfig' href='#'>here</a> if you want to configure the "
"Membership Types below as part of a Price Set, with the added flexibility "
"and complexity that entails."
msgstr "Tukaj kliknite <a id='memQuickconfig' href='#'> </a>, če želite konfigurirati spodnje vrste članstva kot del nabora cen z dodano prilagodljivostjo in zapletenostjo, ki jo prinaša."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.tpl
msgid "Include these membership types"
msgstr "Vključite te vrste članstva"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.tpl
msgid "(Not Available)"
msgstr "(ni na voljo)"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipBlock.tpl
msgid ""
"You need to have at least one <a href=\"%1\">Membership Type</a> with "
"'Public' visibility in order to enable self-service Membership Signup and "
"Renewal."
msgstr "Če želite omogočiti samopostrežno prijavo in podaljšanje članstva, morate imeti vsaj eno vrsto članstva <a href=\"%1\"> </a> z vidnostjo »Javno«."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipCommon.tpl
msgid "Membership payment amount."
msgstr "Znesek članarine."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRelated.tpl
msgid "Related Contacts/Memberships"
msgstr "Povezani stiki/članstva"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRelated.tpl
msgid "Relationship Start"
msgstr "Začetek razmerja"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRelated.tpl
msgid "Relationship End"
msgstr "Konec razmerja"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.tpl
msgid ""
"You will not be able to send an automatic email receipt for this Renew "
"Membership because there is no email address recorded for this contact. If "
"you want a receipt to be sent when this Membership is recorded, click Cancel"
" and then click Edit from the Summary tab to add an email address before "
"Renewal the Membership."
msgstr "Za to obnovitev članstva ne boste mogli poslati samodejnega e-poštnega potrdila, ker za ta stik ni zabeležen e-poštni naslov. Če želite, da se potrdilo pošlje, ko je to članstvo zabeleženo, kliknite Prekliči in nato kliknite Uredi na zavihku Povzetek, da dodate e-poštni naslov, preden obnovite članstvo."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.tpl
msgid "Use this form to renew membership on behalf of %1."
msgstr "Uporabite ta obrazec za podaljšanje članstva v imenu %1."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.tpl
msgid ""
"This membership is set to renew automatically on %2. You will need to cancel"
" the auto-renew option if you want to modify the Membership Type, End Date "
"or Membership Status. <a href=\"%1\">Click here</a> if you want to cancel "
"the automatic renewal option."
msgstr "To članstvo je nastavljeno za samodejno podaljšanje dne %2. Če želite spremeniti vrsto članstva, končni datum ali stanje članstva, boste morali preklicati možnost samodejnega podaljšanja.  <a href=\"%1\"> Kliknite tukaj </a>, če želite preklicati možnost samodejnega podaljšanja."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.tpl
msgid ""
"This membership is set to renew automatically. You will need to cancel the "
"auto-renew option if you want to modify the Membership Type, End Date or "
"Membership Status. <a href=\"%1\">Click here</a> if you want to cancel the "
"automatic renewal option."
msgstr "To članstvo je nastavljeno na samodejno podaljšanje. Če želite spremeniti vrsto članstva, končni datum ali stanje članstva, boste morali preklicati možnost samodejnega podaljšanja.  <a href=\"%1\"> Kliknite tukaj </a>, če želite preklicati možnost samodejnega podaljšanja."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.tpl
msgid "change membership type"
msgstr "spremenite vrsto članstva"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.tpl
msgid "If empty the previous End Date will be used"
msgstr "Če je prazno, bo uporabljen prejšnji končni datum"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.tpl
msgid "membership periods"
msgstr "članska obdobja"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.tpl
msgid "Renewal Payment and Receipt"
msgstr "Plačilo in potrdilo o podaljšanju"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.tpl
msgid "Automatically email a membership confirmation and receipt to %1?"
msgstr "Samodejno poslati potrditev članstva in potrdilo o prejemu na %1?"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.tpl
msgid ""
"Enter a message you want included at the beginning of the emailed receipt."
msgstr "Vnesite sporočilo, ki ga želite vključiti na začetek e-poštnega potrdila."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid "New Membership Status"
msgstr "Novo stanje članstva"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid "Edit Membership Status"
msgstr "Uredi stanje članstva"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid "Delete Membership Status"
msgstr "Izbriši stanje članstva"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid ""
"When does this status begin? EXAMPLE: <strong>New</strong> status begins at "
"the Member Since."
msgstr "Kdaj se začne ta status? PRIMER: <strong> Nov status </strong> se začne pri članu od."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid ""
"Optional adjustment period added or subtracted from the Start Event. "
"EXAMPLE: <strong>Current</strong> status might begin at Member Since PLUS 3 "
"months (to distinguish Current from New members)."
msgstr "Izbirno prilagoditveno obdobje, dodano ali odšteto od začetnega dogodka. PRIMER: <strong> Trenutni status </strong> se lahko začne pri članu od PLUS 3 mesece (za razlikovanje med trenutnimi in novimi člani)."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid ""
"When does this status end? EXAMPLE: <strong>Current</strong> status ends at "
"the Membership Expiration Date."
msgstr "Kdaj preneha ta status? PRIMER: <strong> Trenutni status </strong> se konča na datum poteka članstva."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid ""
"Optional adjustment period added or subtracted from the End Event. EXAMPLE: "
"<strong>Grace</strong> status might end at the Membership Expiration Date "
"PLUS 1 month."
msgstr "Izbirno prilagoditveno obdobje, dodano ali odšteto od končnega dogodka. PRIMER: status <strong> Grace </strong> se lahko konča na datum poteka članstva PLUS 1 mesec."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid ""
"Should this status be considered a current membership in good standing. "
"EXAMPLE: New, Current and Grace could all be considered 'current'."
msgstr "Ali je treba ta status šteti za trenutno članstvo v dobrem stanju. PRIMER: New, Current in Grace se lahko štejejo za \"aktualne\"."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid ""
"Weight sets the order of precedence for automatic assignment of status to a "
"membership. It also sets the order for status displays. EXAMPLE: The default"
" 'New' and 'Current' statuses have overlapping ranges. Memberships that meet"
" both status range criteria are assigned the status with the lower weight."
msgstr "Teža nastavi prednostni vrstni red za samodejno dodelitev statusa članstvu. Nastavi tudi vrstni red prikazov stanja. PRIMER: Privzeti statusi 'Novo' in 'Trenutno' imata prekrivajoča se obsega. Članstva, ki izpolnjujejo oba kriterija statusnega obsega, dobijo status z nižjo težo."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid ""
"The default status is assigned when there are no matching status rules for a"
" membership."
msgstr "Privzeti status je dodeljen, če za članstvo ni ujemajočih se statusnih pravil."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipStatus.tpl
msgid "Is this status enabled."
msgstr "Ali je ta status omogočen."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipType.tpl
msgid ""
"Membership signups on or after this day of the month cover the rest of the "
"month plus the specified number of months."
msgstr "Prijave članstva na ta dan v mesecu ali pozneje pokrivajo preostanek meseca in navedeno število mesecev."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipType.tpl
msgid ""
"Memberships can be automatically granted to related contacts by selecting a "
"Relationship Type."
msgstr "Članstvo lahko samodejno podelite povezanim stikom, tako da izberete vrsto razmerja."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipType.tpl
msgid ""
"There are membership records associated with this membership type. Changing "
"this setting will not automatically update existing memberships (and those "
"that would inherit a membership), which may cause inconsistent results."
msgstr "S to vrsto članstva so povezani zapisi članstva. Spreminjanje te nastavitve ne bo samodejno posodobilo obstoječih članstev (in tistih, ki bi podedovala članstvo), kar lahko povzroči nedosledne rezultate."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipType.tpl
msgid "Renewal Reminders"
msgstr "Opomniki za podaljšanje"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipType.tpl
msgid ""
"Configure membership renewal reminders using <a href=\"%1\">Schedule "
"Reminders</a>. If you have previously configured renewal reminder templates,"
" you can re-use them with your new scheduled reminders."
msgstr "Konfigurirajte opomnike za podaljšanje članstva z <a href=\"%1\"> Opomniki za razpored </a>. Če ste predhodno konfigurirali predloge opomnikov za obnovitev, jih lahko znova uporabite z novimi načrtovanimi opomniki."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipView.tpl
msgid "By Relationship"
msgstr "Po razmerju"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipView.tpl
msgid "View primary member contact summary"
msgstr "Prikaži povzetek stika primarnega člana"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipView.tpl
msgid "Overridden"
msgstr "Preglašeno"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/MembershipView.tpl
msgid "Related Contributions and Recurring Contributions"
msgstr "Sorodni prispevki in ponavljajoči se prispevki"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search/EmptyResults.tpl
msgid "if you are searching by member name, check your spelling"
msgstr "če iščete po imenu člana, preverite črkovanje"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid ""
"Select \"Yes\" to display only primary members (those contacts who have a "
"membership directly attached to their record)"
msgstr "Izberite \"Da\", če želite prikazati samo primarne člane (tiste stike, ki imajo članstvo neposredno priloženo njihovemu zapisu)"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid ""
"Select \"No\" to display only related records (those who inherit membership "
"through a relationship as defined in the membership type configuration)."
msgstr "Izberite »Ne«, če želite prikazati samo povezane zapise (tiste, ki podedujejo članstvo prek razmerja, kot je definirano v konfiguraciji vrste članstva)."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid ""
"Select neither to show all members, regardless of whether they are the "
"direct member or inherit it through a relationship,"
msgstr "Izberite nobenega, da prikažete vse člane, ne glede na to, ali so neposredni člani ali jih podedujejo prek razmerja,"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid ""
"Select \"Yes\" to display only membership with Status Override set "
"(membership is manually forced to a specific status)"
msgstr "Izberite \"Da\", če želite prikazati samo članstvo z nastavljeno preglasitvijo statusa (članstvo je ročno vsiljeno v določen status)"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid ""
"Select \"No\" to display only memberships without Status Override set "
"(membership is subject to the normal status rules)"
msgstr "Izberite \"Ne\", če želite prikazati samo članstva brez nastavljene preglasitve statusa (za članstvo veljajo običajna pravila statusa)"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid "Select neither to show all memberships"
msgstr "Če želite prikazati vsa članstva, ne izberite nobenega"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid ""
"Select \"None\" to display memberships that have never had an auto-renew "
"subscription."
msgstr "Izberite »Brez« za prikaz članstev, ki nikoli niso imela samodejnega podaljšanja naročnine."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid ""
"Select \"In Progress\" to display memberships with current auto-renew "
"subscriptions."
msgstr "Izberite \"V teku\", če želite prikazati članstva s trenutnimi naročninami s samodejnim obnavljanjem."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid "Select \"Failed\" to display memberships with failed subscription payment."
msgstr "Izberite »Neuspešno« za prikaz članstev z neuspelim plačilom naročnine."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid ""
"Select \"Cancelled\" to display memberships with cancelled auto-renew "
"subscriptions."
msgstr "Izberite »Preklicano«, če želite prikazati članstva s preklicanimi naročninami za samodejno podaljšanje."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid ""
"Select \"Ended\" to display memberships with an ended auto-renew "
"subscription."
msgstr "Izberite \"Končano\", če želite prikazati članstva s končano naročnino s samodejnim podaljšanjem."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Search.hlp
msgid ""
"Select \"Any\" to display memberships with auto-renew subscription "
"irrespective of their status."
msgstr "Izberite »Kateri koli« za prikaz članstev s samodejnim podaljšanjem naročnine ne glede na njihov status."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Selector.tpl templates/CRM/Member/Page/Tab.tpl
msgid "by relationship"
msgstr "po razmerju"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Selector.tpl templates/CRM/Member/Page/Tab.tpl
msgid "Auto-renew active"
msgstr "Samodejno podaljšanje je aktivno"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Selector.tpl templates/CRM/Member/Page/Tab.tpl
msgid "Auto-renew error"
msgstr "Napaka pri samodejnem podaljšanju"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Selector.tpl templates/CRM/Member/Page/Tab.tpl
msgid "View Primary member record"
msgstr "Prikaži zapis primarnega člana"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Selector.tpl templates/CRM/Member/Page/Tab.tpl
msgid "View Primary"
msgstr "Prikaži primarnega člana"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Selector.tpl
msgid "View all memberships for this contact"
msgstr "Oglejte si vsa članstva za ta stik"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Selector.tpl
msgid "Find more members"
msgstr "Poišči več članov"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Task/Batch.tpl
msgid ""
"Update field values for each member as needed. Click <strong>Update "
"Memberships</strong> below to save all your changes. To set a field to the "
"same value for ALL rows, enter that value for the first member and then "
"click the <strong>Copy icon</strong> (next to the column title)."
msgstr "Po potrebi posodobite vrednosti polja za vsakega člana. Kliknite <strong> Posodobi članstva </strong> spodaj, da shranite vse svoje spremembe. Če želite polje nastaviti na isto vrednost za VSE vrstice, vnesite to vrednost za prvega člana in nato kliknite <strong> ikono Kopiraj </strong> (zraven naslova stolpca)."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Task/Delete.tpl
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete the selected memberships? This delete "
"operation cannot be undone and will delete all transactions and activity "
"associated with these memberships."
msgstr "Ali ste prepričani, da želite izbrisati izbrana članstva? Te operacije brisanja ni mogoče razveljaviti in izbrisal bo vse transakcije in dejavnosti, povezane s temi članstvi."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Task/PDFLetter.tpl
msgid "Membership Letter (PDF)"
msgstr "Člansko pismo (PDF)"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Form/Task.tpl
msgid "Number of selected memberships: %1"
msgstr "Število izbranih članstev: %1"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Import/Form/Preview.tpl
msgid "Total rows (membership records) in uploaded file."
msgstr "Skupno število vrstic (zapisi o članstvu) v naloženi datoteki."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/DashBoard.hlp
msgid "Refer to the online user guide for more information."
msgstr "Za več informacij glejte spletni uporabniški priročnik."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/DashBoard.hlp
msgid ""
"CiviMember allows you to create customized membership types as well as "
"page(s) for online membership sign-up and renewal. Administrators can create"
" or modify Membership Types <a href='%2'>here</a>, and configure Online "
"Contribution Pages which include membership sign-up <a href='%1'>here</a>."
msgstr "CiviMember vam omogoča, da ustvarite prilagojene tipe članstva ter stran(e) za spletno prijavo in podaljšanje članstva. Skrbniki lahko ustvarijo ali spremenijo vrste članstva <a href='%2'> tukaj </a> in konfigurirajo spletne strani za prispevke, ki vključujejo prijavo za članstvo <a href='%1'> tukaj </a>."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/DashBoard.hlp
msgid ""
"This table provides a summary of <strong>Membership Signup and Renewal "
"Activity</strong>, and includes shortcuts to view the details for these "
"commonly used search criteria. To run your own customized searches - click "
"<a href='%1'>Find Members</a>. You can search by Member Name, Membership "
"Type, Status, and Signup Date Ranges."
msgstr "Ta tabela ponuja povzetek dejavnosti prijave in podaljšanja članstva <strong> </strong> ter vključuje bližnjice za ogled podrobnosti za te pogosto uporabljene kriterije iskanja. Če želite zagnati lastna prilagojena iskanja - kliknite <a href='%1'> Najdi člane </a>. Iščete lahko po imenu člana, vrsti članstva, statusu in datumskih obdobjih prijave."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/DashBoard.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also input and track membership sign-ups offline. To record "
"memberships manually for individual contacts, use <a href=\"%1\">Find "
"Contacts</a> to locate the contact. Then click <strong>View</strong> to go "
"to their summary page and click on the <strong>New Membership</strong> link."
" You can also <a href=\"%2\">import batches of membership records</a> from "
"other sources."
msgstr "Prav tako lahko vnašate in spremljate prijave članstva brez povezave. Če želite ročno zabeležiti članstva za posamezne stike, uporabite <a href=\"%1\"> Najdi stike </a>, da poiščete stik. Nato kliknite <strong> Ogled </strong>, da odprete stran s povzetkom, in kliknite povezavo <strong> Novo članstvo </strong>. <a href=\"%2\"> lahko uvozite tudi pakete članskih zapisov </a> iz drugih virov."

