"one</a>."
msgstr "Ni vnesenega statusa članstva po meri. <a href='%1'> lahko dodate enega </a>."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid ""
"Use this field to configure Membership Types where memberships are "
"automatically granted to related contacts. Examples:"
msgstr "To polje uporabite za konfiguracijo vrst članstva, kjer se članstva samodejno dodelijo povezanim stikom. Primeri:"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid "Direct member is:"
msgstr "Neposredni član je:"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid "Membership is automatically granted to:"
msgstr "Članstvo je samodejno podeljeno:"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid "a household"
msgstr "gospodinjstvo"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid "'Household Members' of that household"
msgstr "„Člani gospodinjstva“ tega gospodinjstva"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid "an organization"
msgstr "organizacija"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid "'Employees' of that organization"
msgstr "'Zaposleni' te organizacije"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid "an individual"
msgstr "posameznik"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid "'Children' of that individual"
msgstr "'Otroci' tega posameznika"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid ""
"Select 'rolling' if membership periods begin at date of signup. Select "
"'fixed' if membership periods begin on a set calendar date. If membership "
"duration is specified in years, you will be able to specify the exact month "
"and day for memberships to start. If membership duration is specified in "
"months, memberships will start on the 1st of the current month and run for "
"the number of specified months."
msgstr "Izberite \"tekoče\", če se obdobja članstva začnejo na datum prijave. Izberite 'fiksno', če se obdobja članstva začnejo na določen koledarski datum. Če je trajanje članstva določeno v letih, boste lahko določili točen mesec in dan začetka članstva. Če je trajanje članstva določeno v mesecih, se članstva začnejo 1. v tekočem mesecu in trajajo določeno število mesecev."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid "EXAMPLES"
msgstr "PRIMERI"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Fixed Membership Period - 1 Year Duration:</strong> Fixed period "
"start date is set to January 1. A person signs up for membership on February"
" 15th, 2008. Their membership start date is set to January 1, 2008 - and the"
" end date is December 31, 2008."
msgstr "<strong> Določeno obdobje članstva - 1 leto Trajanje: </strong> Datum začetka določenega obdobja je nastavljen na 1. januar. Oseba se prijavi za članstvo 15. februarja 2008. Datum začetka članstva je nastavljen na 1. januar 2008 - končni datum pa je 31. december 2008."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Fixed Membership - 3 Months Duration:</strong> A person signs up on "
"February 15th, 2008. Their membership start date is set to February 1, 2008 "
"- and the end date is April 30, 2008."
msgstr "<strong> Fiksno članstvo - 3 mesece Trajanje: </strong> Oseba se vpiše 15. februarja 2008. Datum začetka članstva je nastavljen na 1. februar 2008 - končni datum pa je 30. april 2008."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Rolling Membership Period - 1 Year Duration:</strong> A person signs"
" up on February 15th, 2008. Their membership start date is February 15th, "
"2008 - and the end date is February 14th, 2009."
msgstr "<strong> Tekoče obdobje članstva - 1 leto Trajanje: </strong> Oseba se vpiše 15. februarja 2008. Začetni datum članstva je 15. februar 2008 - končni datum pa 14. februar 2009."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.tpl
msgid ""
"Membership types are used to categorize memberships. You can define an "
"unlimited number of types. Each type incorporates a 'name' (Gold Member, "
"Honor Society Member...), a description, a minimum fee (can be $0), and a "
"duration (can be 'lifetime'). Each member type is specifically linked to the"
" membership entity (organization) - e.g. Bay Area Chapter."
msgstr "Vrste članstva se uporabljajo za kategorizacijo članstev. Določite lahko neomejeno število vrst. Vsaka vrsta vključuje 'ime' (zlati član, član častnega društva ...), opis, minimalno pristojbino (lahko 0 $) in trajanje (lahko 'doživljenjsko'). Vsaka vrsta člana je posebej povezana s subjektom članstva (organizacijo) – npr. Poglavje Bay Area."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.tpl
msgid ""
"Configure membership renewal reminders using <a href=\"%1\">Schedule "
"Reminders</a>."
msgstr "Konfigurirajte opomnike za podaljšanje članstva z <a href=\"%1\"> Opomniki za razpored </a>."

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/Tab.tpl
msgid "Fixed Start"
msgstr "Fiksni začetek"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.tpl
#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/Tab.tpl
msgid "Related"
msgstr "Povezano"

#: templates/CRM/Member/Page/MembershipType.tpl
msgid "Add Membership Type"
msgstr "Dodaj vrsto članstva"

